  "story": [
    "On a shelf where all the flavors of the world come together, all my friends waited to be chosen by someone, but SHIN thought to himself\"Why do I have to wait?\" \"There are so many people who want me!\"",
    "One night, when everyone was asleep, SHIN jumped off the shelf. That was the start of SHIN’s journey to spread Spicy Happiness around the world.",
    "Sometimes my enthusiasm gets ahead of me and I stumble. Other times, I end up on the wrong path. or instead of sitting down right there, SHIN shouts bravely.",
    "\"Even better!\" \"Thanks to that, I get to see this amazing view!\" Even in those unpredictable moments, a new challenge for the next Happiness begins.",
    "Until the day people all around the world enjoy the happiness of spiciness with Spicy Happiness In Noodles, Let's join SHIN's journey together!"
  ],
